@startuml
title CPS User Entity Model

class CPSUser {
  **Primary Key**
  --
  + ID : ObjectID
  --
  **Identity**
  --
  + UserCode : string
  + FullName : string
  + UserName : string
  + Email : string
  + PhoneNumber : string
  + Gender : string
  --
  **Role & Access**
  --
  + Role : string
  + Realm : string
  + Department : ObjectID
  + PermissionCategory : []ObjectID
  + PermissionGroup : []ObjectID
  --
  **Security**
  --
  + Password : types.Password
  + LoginPassword : string
  + PasswordDisable : bool
  + SyncDisabled : bool
  + AccountAuthorizationCode : string
  + UnlockAccountRequested : bool
  --
  **Login Stats**
  --
  + LoginAttemptCount : uint8
  + LastLoginAttempt : time.Time
  + NextLoginAttempt : time.Time
  + LastLogin : time.Time
  + LastOnlineDate : time.Time
  + IsFirstTimeLogin : bool
  --
  **OTP**
  --
  + OTPStatus : string
  + OTPLastTriedAt : *time.Time
  + OPTLastVerifiedAt : *time.Time
  + OTPVerifyCount : int
  --
  **Status & Location**
  --
  + Enabled : bool
  + IsDeleted : bool
  + Country : string
  + Region : string
  --
  **Timestamps**
  --
  + DateJoined : *time.Time
  + LastModified : *time.Time
  + PasswordChangedAt : *time.Time
}

note right of CPSUser::Role
  User role (e.g., Maker, Checker)
end note

note bottom of CPSUser
  **Field Descriptions:**
  **UserCode**: Unique user identifier
  **Realm**: Authentication realm
  **PermissionGroup**: Associated permission groups
  **LoginAttemptCount**: Track failed logins
end note
@enduml
